  "title": "Medieval Manuscripts",
  "title_short": "Medieval Manuscripts",
  "description": "Evaluates models on handwritten text extraction from 15th century medieval manuscripts written in late medieval German. Tests the ability to transcribe historical handwriting, identify folio numbers, separate main text from marginal additions without being given their regions (an implicit segmentation), and maintain historical spelling and formatting. Performance is measured using fuzzy string matching and Character Error Rate (CER).",
